for selection;
       (8) being an ascendant, spouse or child of a Member of the House of
Representatives, a Senator, a political official, a member of a local assembly or a local
administrator, a candidate for selection to become a Senator for the same session, or a person
holding office in the Constitutional Court or in an Independent Organ;
       (9) having held office as a Senator under this Constitution.

Section 111.  Membership of the Senate terminates upon:
  (1) expiration of the term of the Senate;
  (2) death;

